WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Hey, how's it going?

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Nice to meet you.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hello.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
So I'll switch over to the Gaza thing in a second, but first off, I just wanted to touch

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
on that.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.120
You said that you support free speech, of course, right?

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.560
So what I'm confused about is you've refused to debate people that have disagreed with

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.560
you because you said that they're racist or they're fascist, right?

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.560
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.120
If we're going to do facts, they said they were racist and fascist.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.120
Get your facts right before you start arguing.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.120
Okay.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.360
So isn't the whole entire point of the debate to debate people that you don't agree with?

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:27.680
I don't debate people who don't see me, A, as equal, no point, or B, support democracy

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.860
because that would undermine the whole idea of the debate.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.700
If you don't support democracy, as our friend here doesn't, and support General Franco,

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.820
then what is the point of a debate?

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:37.099
The First Amendment doesn't mean you have to debate everyone.

00:00:37.099 --> 00:00:39.779
Somebody comes up to you in the street and starts talking to you, you don't have an obligation

00:00:39.779 --> 00:00:40.779
to carry on talking to them.

00:00:40.779 --> 00:00:42.380
I'm sure you go about your business.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.459
Somebody comes up to you in the subway and sits next to you and starts ranting in your

00:00:44.459 --> 00:00:45.459
face.

00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:46.459
So you're not going to start debating.

00:00:46.459 --> 00:00:48.660
So everyone here has hygiene standards, as do you.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.939
There are people you wouldn't debate, I'm sure, as well.

00:00:50.939 --> 00:00:51.939
Okay.

00:00:51.939 --> 00:00:57.259
So can you please describe why you think Trump is supporting ethnic cleansing of Gaza just

00:00:57.259 --> 00:00:58.959
because he wants to take over the land there?

00:00:58.959 --> 00:00:59.959
How does that equate to killing them?

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.759
And not just take over the land.

00:01:01.759 --> 00:01:02.759
Kick out all the people.

00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:03.759
That is the definition of ethnic cleansing.

00:01:03.759 --> 00:01:05.760
So isn't ethnic cleansing killing people?

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.760
Because it seems like you're-

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.400
No, you can ethnic cleanse people without killing them.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.879
And by the way, they have been killed.

00:01:09.879 --> 00:01:13.720
More than 50,000 people in Gaza have been killed by the Israelis, by people like Bezalel

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:18.440
Smotrich, who said recently, the finance minister of Israel, we are going to Gaza to conquer,

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.199
cleanse, and remain.

00:01:20.199 --> 00:01:21.360
We are going to annihilate the place.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.320
We are going to disassemble Gaza, he said.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.239
We're going to leave it behind as piles of rubble.

00:01:25.239 --> 00:01:26.820
That's the guy Trump's funding, supporting.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.820
That's the guy praising Trump.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.500
So yes, Trump and Smotrich are ethnically cleansing Gaza.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:34.339
I cannot deny that thousands of people are dying in Gaza, but you need to realize, why

00:01:34.339 --> 00:01:35.339
are they dying?

00:01:35.339 --> 00:01:36.339
Is it possibly that they're attacking another country?

00:01:36.339 --> 00:01:37.339
No.

00:01:37.339 --> 00:01:38.580
The people who are dying, we're not attacking another country.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.260
Just because Israel is killing more Gazans than Gazans are killing Israel doesn't mean

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.220
Gaza is righteous and Israel is evil.

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.220
Israel-

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:45.220
I never said anything about evil or righteous.

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:46.220
Israel might be-

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:47.220
I said ethnic cleansing.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:48.220
You said, don't they have to be killed?

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:49.220
I said they are being killed.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:50.739
And the criteria for what's happening to them.

00:01:50.739 --> 00:01:53.779
If Donald Trump says, these people have to leave and never come back, is that not ethnic

00:01:53.779 --> 00:01:54.779
cleansing?

00:01:54.779 --> 00:01:55.779
What is your definition of ethnic cleansing?

00:01:56.339 --> 00:01:59.379
Ethnic cleansing is when you're killing off a large part of an ethnic group.

00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:00.379
That's genocide.

00:02:00.379 --> 00:02:01.379
You're confusing your terms.

00:02:01.379 --> 00:02:06.220
Ethnic cleansing is removing one ethnic group, using a deliberate policy by violence or terror

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:10.139
inspiring means to remove another population, another ethnic group from a certain geographic

00:02:10.139 --> 00:02:11.139
area.

00:02:11.139 --> 00:02:12.139
That's the UN definition of ethnic cleansing.

00:02:12.139 --> 00:02:13.139
That is what he's doing.

00:02:13.139 --> 00:02:14.259
When he was asked, Donald Trump, can they come back?

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:16.380
He said, no, they cannot.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.380
That is ethnic cleansing.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.380
I've heard all these-

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:21.020
We've had people talk about white genocides, and you guys are nationalists.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:24.860
How would you feel if somebody came, a president of France came and told you to leave your

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:25.940
land and not come back?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.259
Would you not feel you'd been ethnically cleansed from your home?

00:02:28.259 --> 00:02:29.259
From America?

00:02:29.259 --> 00:02:30.259
Yeah.

00:02:30.259 --> 00:02:32.699
Well, because my ancestors were settlers here, not immigrants.

00:02:32.699 --> 00:02:33.699
They actually built something-

00:02:33.699 --> 00:02:35.539
Palestinians are not immigrants in Gaza.

00:02:35.539 --> 00:02:37.100
They are indigenous people to the land.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.619
Didn't Israel just give Gaza land a few decades ago?

